id: flash-input-lock
section: Flash
item: The gesture lock is engaged by the first tap on a movie (no keyboard with it) and released by a tap outside: engaged, a drag moves the movie and not the page; a double tap on the engaged movie raises the keyboard; released or outside the movie, the page pans
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&over=1
kit: cavekit-flash.md R5
wait text ready stage= 30
drag 650 700 650 600 600
wait settled 5
expect card-scroll-min 30
expect number n-move 0 0
card-to 0
wait settled 5
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect number n-down 1 1
expect number n-up 1 1
expect keyboard down
pause 800
drag 240 340 240 240 600
wait settled 5
expect card-scroll 0 10
expect number n-move 5 400
dtap 240 272
expect keyboard up
pause 2500
tap-at 650 500
expect keyboard down
pause 800
drag 650 700 650 600 600
wait settled 5
expect card-scroll-min 30
